<title>FRANCE: Schneider 1996 sales up 3.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Schneider 1996 sales up 3.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					61,615    vs   59,420</p>
<p>Of which</p>
<p>    -- Schneider Electric		     43,837    vs   41,953</p>
<p>    -- Spie Batignolles			 17,416    vs   17,026</p>
<p>    -- Divers					  492    vs	559</p>
<p>NOTE - Schneider gave the figures in a statement.</p>
</text>
